      {
        "id": 140859,
        "name": "Phantom5613",
        "username": "Phantom5613",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-30T19:16:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"OCMike123\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/o/ed655f/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> OCMike123:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>OK, what other Marvel/DC universe archetypes are in SoTM?&nbsp; I'm having a hard time finding an equivalent to The Argent Adept -&nbsp;and Aqashbuta seems pretty darn unique as well.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Well there's quite a few obvious ones(Legacy=Captain America/Superman=Super Soldier!, Tachyon=Flash, Bunker=Iron Man/War Machine,ExPatriette=Punisher), but then there's others who appear more unique. I'd love to make a full list of each character when I have the time.</p>\n<p>Argent Adept is easiest compared to most sorcerer-type characters, like Dr. Strange or Zatana, but I'm not sure about the musical half of the character. I'm certain there's a few music themed ones that were generated in the 80s and 70s(google Vibe from DC Comics), but I doubt that they're in the foreground.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
